==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 1 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Lapras ex Drop Event]], which ran from November 5 to 18, 2024.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Bubble Drain''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Everyone's Exciting Battle|Azumarill|12}} from the {{TCG|Everyone's Exciting Battle}} collection.

